@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# Bulk member import
+
+An org admin uploads a CSV with `email,name,role` columns to
+`POST /api/import`. Rows are staged, then promoted to memberships.
+
+## Auditing
+
+Every membership change writes an audit record; the Prisma middleware refuses
+any mutating query that does not carry one. The staging writes are the single
+exception — they are scratch rows the operator can discard, so the importer
+marks them as a system operation before writing and the promotion step runs
+audited as normal.
+
+## Limits
+
+- 5 MB per upload
+- rows are staged in chunks of 200
+- unknown roles fall back to `member`
